C VERREE    SOURCE    CB215821  20/03/02    21:15:19     10540          
*  verification reel
*
      subroutine verree(xval,resul)
      implicit real*8 (a-h,o-z)

-INC PPARAM
-INC CCOPTIO
-INC CCREEL
      logical resul
*
      resul = .false.
      if (xval .le. xgrand .and. xval .ge. -xgrand) resul = .true.
      end







































































































 
 
